  "asset_path_migration": "city.glb moved from assets/city.glb to data/raw/scenes/city.glb. The model is a third-party CC BY 4.0 asset but also a pipeline input, so its location follows the data flow (source -> input -> expected) and its origin is recorded in ATTRIBUTION.md instead of the directory name. Only path references changed; no algorithm or numeric result.",
