  "off_migration": "Converted the five data/input meshes and eight tracked generated meshes from .geom to OFF by prepending the OFF magic line, and the five data/expected path fixtures to .paths.json. Parsers were unified on src/mesh.read_off and src/verification.read_paths; writers emit OFF and JSON. Geometry, telemetry and simulation results are unchanged; dependent fingerprints were propagated and verified.",
