  "data_pipeline": "data/raw holds the untouched sources. tools/standardize.py writes a standardized Y-up scene, tools/off2glb.py converts fixtures to Z-up GLB for Gazebo, and tools/triangulation.py builds the navigation surface. The standardized scene is a derived cache and is not committed.",
